    - target: {fileID: 9070986682265164292, guid: 5544226b037396441bbf3325159d66b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\tBad news. They decided I will be the one to process the alien meat.
        My luck.\n\r\n\tI had a long talk with Yukari and Giovanni about it. I told
        them that I'm not a good fit for this role, that I really freak out when
        I touch the raw meat. I was vegan in the old days, you know.\n\r\n\tBut let's
        be honest, I'm kind of a dead weight here. What good is a hair stylist in
        a colony struggling for survival? And someone has to take care of that meat."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
